00:00:23.387 --> 00:00:26.657
and the last one is for the heart.

00:00:27.458 --> 00:00:29.994
So they're really depressing,
you're welcome, see ya.

00:00:29.994 --> 00:00:31.162
(Laughter)

00:00:34.432 --> 00:00:35.633
